{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed by Baron Samedi, you awaken as a voodoo doll bound to endless trials. The pin driven through your chest is not just a mark of suffering\u2014it\u2019s the key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voody Hex</strong> is a roguelike platformer where you cannot strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Instead, you endure. You dodge. You adapt. Each round survived forces you to choose a new curse, twisting the arena against you\u2014 threatening field, relentless foes, dreadful alterations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet every curse feeds your growth, granting the possibility to claim new powers: a rescuing double jump, a desperate dash, a fragile chance to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and maybe Voody can break its chains. Fail, and the Baron\u2019s laughter echoes once more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every needle hurts. Every needle pays.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946960/extras/d15f0bbbb6e835f36371aa58c2377bb2.poster.avif?t=1765545108\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946960/extras/d15f0bbbb6e835f36371aa58c2377bb2.webm?t=1765545108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946960/extras/d15f0bbbb6e835f36371aa58c2377bb2.mp4?t=1765545108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They never stop coming. You never stop dodging.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946960/extras/b2126092480040a604cacbf08b91f74e.poster.avif?t=1765545108\" width=400 height=250 ><